{
  "name": "Monitor SEC EDGAR Form D Startup Funding & Insider Signals to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly SEC EDGAR Form D Startup Funding & Form 4 Cluster Buys Alert\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow monitors official SEC EDGAR filings every week and sends high-signal startup funding rounds and multi-insider cluster buys to Slack:\n1. **Weekly Schedule Trigger** kicks off the monitoring run automatically.\n2. **Fetch SPV-Filtered Form D Rounds** calls `POST /funding` on RapidAPI (`sec-edgar-form-d-funding-form-4-insider-8-k-api`) with `excludeFunds: true` and `excludeSpvs: true` to isolate operating US startup financings.\n3. **Split Out Funding Rounds** turns the `items` array into individual deal records.\n4. **Filter Significant Rounds ($1M+)** keeps rounds with at least `$1,000,000` sold, then **Format SEC Filing Digest** extracts company, amount sold, state, industry, CEO, and official SEC filing URL.\n5. **Send Funding Alert to Slack** posts concise deal briefs to `#sec-signals`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Subscribe to the free Basic plan on RapidAPI (`sec-edgar-form-d-funding-form-4-insider-8-k-api` — 500 free req/mo).\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named `RapidAPI Key` (`x-rapidapi-key`) and select it in **Fetch SPV-Filtered Form D Rounds**.\n3. Connect your **Slack** credential and choose your channel in **Send Funding Alert to Slack**.\n4. Adjust lookback `days` or `minAmountSoldUsd` and click **Execute workflow**.\n\n### Customization\n- Switch the endpoint to `/insiders/clusters` to alert on multi-insider Form 4 open-market cluster buys, or `/events` for Form 8-K EX-99.1 corporate catalysts.\n- Pipe **Format SEC Filing Digest** to **Airtable**, **HubSpot**, or **Google Sheets** to maintain a live VC sourcing ledger.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "fil-overview-note",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Schedule Trigger\nRuns weekly (or daily) to pull the latest official SEC EDGAR filings automatically.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "fil-sec-1",
      "name": "Step 1: Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Fetch & Split Form D Rounds\nCalls `POST /funding` with dual SPV & pooled-fund filters enabled, then splits out each startup filing.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fil-sec-2",
      "name": "Step 2: Fetch & Split",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Filter $1M+ Rounds & Format\nKeeps meaningful operating rounds (`>= $1,000,000` sold) and formats company, CEO, state, industry, and SEC link.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "fil-sec-3",
      "name": "Step 3: Filter & Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        860,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Post Deal Brief to Slack\nSends each formatted SEC Form D funding alert directly to `#sec-signals`.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "fil-sec-4",
      "name": "Step 4: Slack Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "fil-trigger-1",
      "name": "Weekly Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        60,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://sec-edgar-form-d-funding-form-4-insider-8-k-api.p.rapidapi.com/funding",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-rapidapi-host",
              "value": "sec-edgar-form-d-funding-form-4-insider-8-k-api.p.rapidapi.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ days: 7, excludeFunds: true, excludeSpvs: true, minAmountSoldUsd: 1000000, maxResults: 20 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "fil-http-2",
      "name": "Fetch SPV-Filtered Form D Rounds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        400,
        260
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "RapidAPI Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "items",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fil-split-3",
      "name": "Split Out Funding Rounds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "fil-cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.totalAmountSoldUsd || $json.sold || 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 1000000,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "fil-if-4",
      "name": "Filter Significant Rounds ($1M+)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "name": "company",
              "value": "={{ $json.companyName || $json.company || 'Unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f2",
              "name": "amountSoldUsd",
              "value": "={{ $json.totalAmountSoldUsd || $json.sold || 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f3",
              "name": "state",
              "value": "={{ $json.state || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f4",
              "name": "industry",
              "value": "={{ $json.industryGroup || $json.industry || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f5",
              "name": "secUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.filingUrl || $json.url || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "fil-set-5",
      "name": "Format SEC Filing Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#sec-signals"
        },
        "text": "={{ 'SEC Form D Round — ' + $json.company + ' (' + $json.state + ', ' + $json.industry + '): $' + $json.amountSoldUsd + ' sold | ' + $json.secUrl }}"
      },
      "id": "fil-slack-6",
      "name": "Send Funding Alert to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1520,
        240
      ]
    }
  ],
